# Public deposit allowlist.
# Everything is excluded by default; only the entries un-ignored below are
# published. This is deliberate: the manuscript, the Supplementary Information
# document, the reporting checklists, the journal shortlist, the run logs and
# the pre-submission review material stay local.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/CITATION.cff
!/Codes/
!/plan/
!/data/
!/results/
!/figures/

# Build and editor noise anywhere inside the allowed trees
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
